# Analyze the Pollen cast WITHOUT collecting evidence: "Search your library for a basic land card ... Reveal that card, put it
# into your hand, then shuffle." Griselbrand (mana value 8) is in Bot1's graveyard, so collecting evidence 8 IS offered, and
# Bot1 declines it (so no card is exiled). Only a basic land may be found: the nonbasic Overgrown Tomb, the Llanowar Elves and
# the Lightning Bolt are refused, and a Forest is taken, revealed and put in hand. The positive control is the evidence scenario,
# where the same Elves and Tomb are found.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Faithless Looting
Analyze the Pollen
Griselbrand
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Overgrown Tomb
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Island x10

